3XmUGos5LxzXpGitmgFgNekJu1pbsw&oe=6B006BFA"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "858813137966869", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162739_1730798390476953_1811104045_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_EWUF2hyPe4Q7kNvwGqZeCs&_nc_oc=AdryoRJ9tNbcwcEqk51wUisVQOcNfNQpv7f9RsbT3NkmWPSIeXlMsHZfI54gepRgWR0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQQnw39LnHhe8uY-llclL5YYmJdzPqMD7adVdwcKW413g&oe=6B005A4F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Anshar Wars 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The Ansharian Empire is in peril.  The Nergal, an ancient and fierce enemy,\n\nhave unleashed a galactic super-weapon capable of decimating entire \n\nplanets.  Take on the role of a newly enlisted pilot in the deadliest squad in \n\nthe Ansharian arsenal.  Bring the fight to the Nergal in dazzling ship-to-ship \n\nbattles in deep space and lush planetary surfaces.\n\nUtilize a variety of weapon and ship power ups such as missiles, \n\novercharged lasers, tesla blasts, and portal generators to transform your \n\nfighter into a powerful war-machine and cut down the Nergal forces \n\nwherever the fight may take you. Fly a variety of spacecraft including the \n\nAnsharian Fighter, Bomber, and EMP ship. Gear VR technology allows you \n\nto see the fight all around you, real-time, for fast-paced and accurate \n\ncombat awareness.  Steer your ship by simply moving your head, dodging \n\nspace debris, asteroid fields and huge Nergal capital ships.", "short_description": ""}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.ozwe.com/aw2", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.ozwe.com/tos", "publisher_name": "OZWE", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.ozwe.com/aw2", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_s